        "text": "Thirsk , 27 September 1604 . His wife is said to have died in 1571 , but she is named in his mother 's will , written in 1577 . Sir Henry Belasyse ( 1555-1624 ) , 1st bt . Belasyse , Sir Henry ( 1555-1624 ) , kt . and 1st bt . Third but eldest surviving son of Sir William Belasyse ( c.1523-1604 ) , kt . and his wife Margaret , daughter of Sir Nicholas Fairfax of Walton and Gilling ( Yorks NR ) , baptised at Coxwold , 14 June 1555 . Educated at Jesus College"
